/// given `tag`. This operation cannot be used as a terminator.
///
/// Example:
///
/// ```mlir
/// llvm.func @f() -> !llvm.ptr {
///   %addr = llvm.blockaddress <function = @f, tag = <id = 1>> : !llvm.ptr
///   llvm.br ^bb1
/// ^bb1:
///   llvm.blocktag <id = 1>
