///   llvm.blocktag <id = 0>
///   llvm.return %arg0 : i32
///   ...
/// ```
///
/// It also supports a list of operands that can be passed to a target block:
///
/// ```mlir
///   llvm.indirectbr %dest : !llvm.ptr, [
